==Description==

The [[Image:Assembly_LinkSelectLinked.svg|24px]] [[Assembly_LinkSelectLinked|Assembly LinkSelectLinked]] tool opens the source document of a linked assembly.

==Usage==

# Select a linked assembly.
# Select the {{MenuCommand|Assembly → [[Image:Assembly_LinkSelectLinked.svg|16px]] Go to Linked Assembly}} option from the menu.
# The source document of the linked assembly is opened and the assembly is selected.


